<title>SINGAPORE: Int. Factors 1st-half net rises 63 pct.</title>
<headline>Int. Factors 1st-half net rises 63 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				2.93 vs   1.80</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     2.9  vs   1.8</p>
<p>    Turnover				 16.36 vs  11.59</p>
<p>    Investment income		     0.38 vs   0.36</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    5.46 vs   4.16</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization	   1.52 vs   0.78</p>
<p>    Provisions (expense)		  1.72 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  2.96 vs   1.62</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	     1.63 vs   1.38</p>
<p>    Tax					 1.66 vs   1.20</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries			  nil vs   0.22 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Full name International Factors (S) Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
